    {
      "name": "Inexorable March",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The stone bulwark Strides up to its Speed, pushing back each creature whose space it moves into and damaging them if they try to stop its movement. A creature can attempt to bar the way by succeeding at a DC 34 Fortitude Saving Throw save. On a critical success, the resisting creature takes no damage; otherwise it is damaged as if hit by the construct's fist.</p>",
